    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d551">

                <pb facs="0617" n="537" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg537"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Queen Alexandra to
                        President Roosevelt.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-07-04"><hi rendition="#italic">July 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The King is most grateful for kind sympathy; is, thank God, going on very
                    favorably now.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alexandra</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
